    -->
    <string name="app_name">AGO Chat</string>

    <!--
        `26-12`: the launch screen. It **names no deployment** — no hostname, no environment name,
        nothing under the button (`navigation.md`: an operator holding the app has no reason to think
        about the web console at all, and the debugging need that line served is served better by the
        build variant's own name in Settings → О приложении, which is `26-17`'s).
    -->
    <string name="sign_in_tagline">Отвечайте посетителям, где бы вы ни были</string>
    <string name="sign_in_action">Войти</string>
    <string name="sign_in_working">Выполняется вход…</string>

    <!--
        `11-17`, ported: the identity provider refusing and the call *after* a successful sign-in
        failing are different problems with different fixes, so they are different messages. This one
        is Keycloak's own round trip.
